window.NEWS_DATA.en = {"three":[{"t":"Brazil's presidential election: President Lula wins a very close race for a fourth term","x":"In the runoff on the 25th, with almost 100% of votes counted, Lula had 51.79% and Flavio Bolsonaro had 48.21% (Xinhua, Jiji, AFP, Bloomberg). Flavio said it is \"impossible to accept the result\" (Xinhua, France24). Brazil is an important country for the food and resources Japan buys, such as soybeans and iron ore. Oil stays at its highest price in about six months from the 23rd."},{"t":"Rain from the former typhoon: heavy rain from Kyushu to Kanto today, getting stronger in Kanto around the time people go home","x":"A low-pressure system that was Typhoon No. 30 and a front pass over western Japan on the 26th. The rain gets stronger in Kyushu until early afternoon, in Shikoku and Kinki from late morning to late night, and in Tokai and Kanto from evening to early on the 27th (NHK, tenki.jp, Weathernews). In Nagasaki, a 79-year-old man who seems to have gone to check his boat died (NHK, NBC Nagasaki). Go home early and stay away from rivers and channels."},{"t":"Shogi: Japan is about to get its first woman professional \"kishi\" player. Tomoka Nishiyama makes her decision","x":"On the 26th, Tomoka Nishiyama, who holds four women's titles, said she will use her right to become a \"kishi\" (a full professional player). She will start in April next year as a \"Free Class 4-dan\" and become the first woman kishi in shogi history (NHK, Nikkei, Sponichi, Daily). Until now, the women's professional system and the kishi system, which anyone can join, were separate, and no woman had become a kishi."}],"top10":[{"t":"Rain from former Typhoon No. 30: heavy rain from Kyushu to Kanto today, getting stronger in Kanto from evening","x":"A low and a front from Typhoon No. 30 pass over western Japan on the 26th. In Tokai and Kanto, the rain gets stronger from evening until early on the 27th, with thunder in some places (NHK, tenki.jp, Weathernews). In Minamishimabara, Nagasaki, a 79-year-old man who seems to have gone to check his boat before the typhoon died at a port (NHK, NBC Nagasaki).","w":[["front","前線"],["landslide","土砂崩れ"]]},{"t":"Former Prime Minister Yasuo Fukuda has died at 90. He was prime minister for about a year from 2007 and chaired the Toyako Summit","x":"Jiji, AFP, Nikkei and the Jomo Shimbun reported it. According to AFP, he died on the 22nd. He worked to improve relations with China.","w":[["former prime minister","元首相"],["summit","サミット(首脳会議)"]]},{"t":"Tomoka Nishiyama will become a kishi. In April next year she will be the first woman kishi in history","x":"On the 26th, Nishiyama, who holds four women's titles, said she will use her right to become a kishi. She starts as a \"Free Class 4-dan\" (NHK, Nikkei, Sponichi, Daily).","w":[["professional player","プロの棋士"],["history","歴史"]]},{"t":"Brazil's presidential election: President Lula wins a very close race and is elected for the fourth time","x":"In the runoff on the 25th, with 99.99% of votes counted, Lula had 51.79% and Senator Flavio Bolsonaro had 48.21% (Xinhua). Jiji, AFP, Bloomberg, CBS and NPR also reported Lula's win. Lula said he will work with Congress, where many members are conservative. Flavio said it is \"impossible to accept the result\" and asked for the election to be canceled (Xinhua, France24 headline). The new term starts in January 2027 and lasts four years.","w":[["runoff","決選投票"],["term","任期"]]},{"t":"With hacking cases continuing, the Prime Minister joined a meeting of ministers and said an emergency plan will be put together next week","x":"The Prime Minister said the government will make emergency measures within next week and will think about every option, including \"access neutralization\" to stop the source of attacks (Jiji, Reuters, Tokyo Shimbun).","w":[["emergency measures","緊急の対策"],["option","選択肢"]]},{"t":"Electronics store Joshin (Joshin Denki): information of up to about 6.23 million members and others may have leaked after hacking. Two driver's license images too","x":"Jiji and INTERNET Watch reported it.","w":[["leak","漏れる"],["driver's license","運転免許証"]]},{"t":"The Nikkei average fell 503 yen to 62,189 yen, down for a third day and the lowest in about three months. AI and chip stocks were sold","x":"Jiji, Kyodo and QUICK reported it. The TOPIX rose (DZH).","w":[["stock","株"],["third day in a row","3日続けて"]]},{"t":"Egypt's parliament approved military support to protect Saudi Arabia if Saudi Arabia asks. A Qatari mediator visited Iran, and oil fell about 1% on the 26th","x":"The National, US News, Investing.com and CNBC reported it. North Sea Brent was 116.72 dollars on the 23rd, the highest in about six months. This connects to gas and power bills.","w":[["parliament","議会"],["mediator","仲介役"]]},{"t":"Japan Series: SoftBank leads 2-0 (both games went to extra innings). Today is a travel day, and Game 3 is at 6 p.m. on the 27th in Fukuoka","x":"NHK, Chunichi Sports and Sankei Sports reported it.","w":[["travel day","移動日"],["extra innings","延長戦"]]},{"t":"Number of House of Representatives seats: the DPFP proposes cutting 19 proportional seats and opposes the LDP's plan to cut 31. The party holds the key in the upper house","x":"Jiji, Kyodo, Sankei and ANN reported it. This is bad for prediction N29 (the 31-seat cut passes in this Diet session).","w":[["proposal","案"],["oppose","反対する"]]}],"ex":{"saudi":"In the Middle East, the Houthis and Saudi Arabia keep fighting, and oil prices are at a six-month high. This connects to gas and power bills in Japan.","tax":"A plan to lower the tax on food you buy at the supermarket from 8% to 1%. It has not been decided yet.","cyber":"Bad actors keep breaking into the computers of companies and government offices and stealing information such as names and addresses.","mmx":"A Japanese probe has left for Mars. The plan is to bring back sand from a small moon near Mars.","sato":"The Hanshin Tigers agreed to let Sato, this year's \"Triple Crown\" hitter, try to play in Major League Baseball in America.","series":"These are the games to decide Japan's best pro baseball team. SoftBank won both of the first two games in extra innings and leads 2-0.","yokohama":"There was an election to choose the leader (mayor) of Yokohama, and a new person was chosen.","past":"Three weeks of worries about a big typhoon and a volcano, a new governor of Okinawa and new ministers, and higher interest rates in America.","ukr":"Talks to end the war between Russia and Ukraine may be held again in November. Nothing has been decided yet.","typhoon":"Typhoon No. 30 changed into an extratropical low on the night of the 25th. On the 26th, heavy rain is possible from Kyushu to Kanto.","shogi":"Shogi player Tomoka Nishiyama decided to become a \"kishi,\" the professional player status open to both men and women. In April next year she will be the first woman kishi in shogi history."}};
